# Milestone 5: one bellows for every reed, the arm pushing steadily (CC 11
# at 80, about 400 Pa in a still bellows), pulling. Render it twice, with
# `--set bellows_response=0` (Arm) and `=1` (Stiff), to hear the arm give way.
0 bellows 80
# Clarinet, then Master on the same held note: five reeds draw the
# pressure down a little.
0 register clarinet
0 5800 65 100
2500 register master
# The air button pressed with the note held, then let go.
7000 register clarinet
7000 6000 65 100
9000 air 1
11000 air 0
